{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21835","headline":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 二 · 元稹","name":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水环环兮山簇簇，啼鸟声声妇人哭。\n离牀别脸睡还开，灯灺暗飘珠蔌蔌。\n山深虎横馆无门，夜集巴儿扣空木。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}